SUMMARY:Suzanne Jackson in Conversation with Imani Perry
LOCATION:465 Bar and Restaurant\, Boston\, MA
URL:https://www.mfa.org/event/deborah-and-martin-hale-visiting-artist-lect
 ure/suzanne-jackson-in-conversation-with-imani?event=179141
DESCRIPTION:Join artist Suzanne Jackson and scholar and writer Imani Perry
  for an exploration of Jackson’s six-decade career\, celebrated in the MF
 A exhibition “Suzanne Jackson: What Is Love.” From her ethereal early can
 vases to recent abstractions that suspend paint in midair\, Jackson has c
 ontinually reinvented her practice while remaining rooted in memory\, pla
 ce\, and material exploration.\n\nhttps://www.mfa.org/event/deborah-and-m
 artin-hale-visiting-artist-lecture/suzanne-jackson-in-conversation-with-i
 mani?event=179141
END:VEVENT
