SUMMARY:BEER RELEASE: CHANGING 500 NEW ENGLAND IPA
LOCATION:Break Rock Brewing\, North Quincy\, MA
URL:https://breakrockbrewing.com/event/beer-release-changing-500-new-engla
 nd-ipa/
DESCRIPTION:Changing 500 | 7.77% ABV | New England IPA | Untapped Availabl
 e on draft and in cans to-go. “Changing 500!” You know the guy. Inspired 
 by the legendary blackjack dealer from Vegas Vacation\, this hazy and jui
