SUMMARY:Exhibition: "Shadows and Light: Symbolist Art in Belgium\; Works f
 rom the Hearn Family Trust"
LOCATION:Robsham Theater Arts Center\, Chestnut Hill\, MA
URL:https://events.bc.edu/event/exhibition-shadows-and-light-symbolist-art
 -in-belgium-works-from-the-hearn-family-trust
DESCRIPTION:Showcasing the most important collection of Belgian symbolist 
 art in private hands—assembled by Charles Hack over more than four decade
