 tnoh%40import.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics
DESCRIPTION:In this contemporary scene workshop\, you will apply the lesso
 ns of Acting 1 and 2 to the preparation\, rehearsal\, and presentation of
  scenes\, focusing on contemporary realist plays (mid-20th century to pre
 sent). Scenes are presented in class for critique\, then reworked to expl
 ore and apply feedback. Technique exercises may be introduced diagnostica
 lly to address problems as they arise. Learn more …\n\nhttps://calendar.g
