SUMMARY:Sh!t-Faced Shakespeare: Romeo & Juliet
LOCATION:Rockwell\, Somerville\, MA
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/sht-faced-shakespeare-romeo-juliet/20
 27-01-02/
DESCRIPTION:Sh!t-Faced Shakespeare: Romeo & Juliet “Call me but love\, and
  I’ll be new baptized.” There is no love lost between the Capulet and Mon
 tague families and everyone in Verona knows it. Certainly the only way to
