SUMMARY:Speaking Voice 1 - MCW6TU-WI27
LOCATION:HB Studio\, New York\, NY
URL:https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/skc2ka0pabj6m2osllljrfs6tp70
 tnoh%40import.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics
DESCRIPTION:Training in voice work begins with the cultivation of deep phy
 sical awareness. Specific attention will be given to how the body--bones\
